  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x71" flags="0x30">
    <title>KLTIKRPR_flow_vs_dp</title>
    <description>Flow correction over the differential pressure across the injector. value * sqrt(dp) is constant to 1 % - the Bernoulli orifice law. frt = (KRKATE * KLTIKRPR) &gt;&gt; 14, so the value carries KRKATE's ms/% scaling and no unit is claimed for it. curve_1d_shared at CPU 0x5C72F8 (file 0x1C72F8), 12x1 u16. FR module %RKTI, p1826. Name: HYPOTHESIS. Scaling: STATIC. Read by FUN_000ac4bc@0x0AC4BC. Name evidence: B6 #14 re/findings/injection.md S5.2; interpolated inline at 0x0AC50C on the 0x5D3DBE key. B6 #14: not found by enumerate_maps.py - fkkvs_func interpolates it inline at 0x0AC50C-0x0AC524 on the key from axis_search_u16_hint (0x0AC4EC), so there is no lookup_* call site. Pointer built by subi r3,r2,0x2CF8 at 0x0AC4F8. 12 x u16 = 28344 20029 16605 13558 10854 8868 7369 6373 5415 4710 4088 3736; value*sqrt(dp) constant to 1 %, the Bernoulli orifice law. FR KLTIKRPR. re/findings/injection.md 5.2</description>
