  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xFC" flags="0x30">
    <title>cand_KFMIRL</title>
    <description>Relative charge setpoint from the torque setpoint (KFMIRL): rlsol = f(misol, nmot). 0..111.1 %. This is the map the engine runs on in steady state; 0x5C91F2 is blended in only while the counter 0x7FD448 is non-zero. map_2d_data at CPU 0x5C9372 (file 0x1C9372), 12x16 u16. FR module %MDFUE, p724. Name: HYPOTHESIS. Scaling: STATIC. Read by FUN_00434c14@0x434C14. Name evidence: E3 #41: FUN_00434C14 is %MDFUE. It writes key 0x7FD8C8 = axis_search_u16(0x5C968C, 0x8035E6) at 0x434C2C and key 0x7FD8C4 = axis_search_u16(0x5C9672, nmot_w) at 0x434C3C, then interp_2d_u16(map, nx = u16@0x5C9672 = 12, key_y, key_x) at 0x434C90; the result 0x80351E is the (1-t) term of the blend and the only term left once the counter 0x7FD448 has run out, so this is the steady-state map. Output 0x803522 -&gt; 0x803510 -&gt; 0x803508, the x input of every KFPRSOL* map (rail.md S3.1). FR %MDFUE p724 declares KFMIRL(nmot_w, misop..._w) -&gt; rlmd..._w with exactly this role. enumerate_maps.py; interp_2d_u16; 1 call site(s): 0x434C90; axes matched positionally to the axis searches in the same function</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="0x18"/>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="0x8"/>
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x00" mmedaddress="0x1C9674" mmedelementsizebits="16" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0"/>
      <indexcount>12</indexcount>
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
